stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Prepared
    Prepared --> Receiving: stream bytes
    Prepared --> Abandoned: TTL expires
    Receiving --> Durable: required receipts fsynced
    Receiving --> Abandoned: bad checksum or cancelled
    Durable --> Committed: Raft atomic commit + audit outbox
    Durable --> Abandoned: epoch failed or timeout
    Committed --> Acked: HTTP 2xx delivered
    Committed --> AckUnknown: connection dropped
    AckUnknown --> Acked: operation id query reconciles
    Abandoned --> [*]: safe orphan recovery
    Acked --> [*]
